{"unit_id": "Sjkhx__yukinoDigital#feature-01", "repo": "Sjkhx/yukinoDigital", "commit": "8d1721da82b9279da1f7a5937a5aa3613b5ef1a4", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "Yukino DSH 的功能「DSH 侧边陪伴面板」：在 DSH Web 页面右侧加入可收起的紧凑面板，内嵌助手页并提供新会话、历史会话和弹出独立窗口入口。点击页面右下角按钮可显示或隐藏面板。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:309-385"]}
{"unit_id": "Sjkhx__yukinoDigital#feature-02", "repo": "Sjkhx/yukinoDigital", "commit": "8d1721da82b9279da1f7a5937a5aa3613b5ef1a4", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "Yukino DSH 的功能「任务完成语音点评」：监测 DSH 会话从运行中变为结束，读取近期消息作为摘要并发送给本地 orchestrator，由雪乃生成点评和语音播报。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:53-85", "lib/client.js:113-206", "yukino/voxemw/avatar/orchestrator.py:1013-1058"]}
